        <mxCell id="c3b0" value="· main: 8 SF boards over six asset bundles&#xa;&#160;&#160;+ 24 inspect_evals imports (pin: 6 boards)&#xa;· plugin socket: entry-point discovery (OME-1115)&#xa;· each Benchmark carries a BenchmarkInstaller&#xa;&#160;&#160;(node, assets_root) registering its routes&#xa;&#160;&#160;at Runner boot&#xa;· a CheckSurface declares mid-run checking" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;fontColor=#dbe4f0;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c3">
          <mxGeometry x="14" y="96" width="352" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3h1" value="THE GAP" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=9;fontColor=#f87171;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="c3">
          <mxGeometry x="14" y="194" width="352" height="12" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c3b1" value="A curated catalog — BenchmarkRegistry is an&#xa;immutable container, not a socket. SF's&#xa;refactor closes third-party authorship;&#xa;content private from the platform is not&#xa;theirs to close, and stays ours." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Courier New;fontSize=11;fontColor=#dbe4f0;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="c3">
          <mxGeometry x="14" y="210" width="352" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
